3d904fb79881128fc30cbc92bf4ec298776372d2f80d954050b4d7e358171263  target/release/myvcs
A lightweight VCS with SSH team collaboration

Usage: myvcs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  remote    Configure named remotes (SSH or local subprocess transport)
  push      
  fetch     
  pull      
  config    
  tag       
  audit     
  clone     
  serve     Protocol-only stdio service. Root must be configured by the operator
  upgrade   
  reflog    
  recover   
  init      
  add       
  rm        
  status    
  diff      
  commit    
  log       
  reset     
  branch    
  checkout  
  merge     
  gc        
  verify    
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --repo <REPO>  
  -h, --help         Print help
